],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。关系变量、无二阶量词矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\">\\(\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]\\)</span>、自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2\\)</span> 和形式量词块取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>；模型类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k\">\\(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k\\)</span> 是有限关系变量序列；分量在每个块内及不同块之间均不重复。空块允许出现，空块量词是恒等构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma,\\qquad\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}}[\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma,\\qquad\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q_i^{\\exists}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\quad\\mathsf Q_i^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf Q_i^{\\exists}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\quad\\mathsf Q_i^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left(\\bar R_i\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)|=|\\bar R_i|\\right),\\\\&amp;\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left(i\\ne j\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)\\cap\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_j)=\\varnothing\\right),\\\\&amp;\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)],\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left(\\bar R_i\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)|=|\\bar R_i|\\right),\\\\&amp;\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left(i\\ne j\\to\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)\\cap\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_j)=\\varnothing\\right),\\\\&amp;\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R_i)],\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\psi)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf Q_1^{\\exists}\\bar R_1)\\cdots(\\mathsf Q_k^{\\exists}\\bar R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf Q_1^{\\exists}\\bar R_1)\\cdots(\\mathsf Q_k^{\\exists}\\bar R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf Q_1^{\\forall}\\bar R_1)\\cdots(\\mathsf Q_k^{\\forall}\\bar R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf Q_1^{\\forall}\\bar R_1)\\cdots(\\mathsf Q_k^{\\forall}\\bar R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_k^1[\\tau]\\},\\quad Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_k^1[\\tau]\\},\\quad Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §7.3，印刷页119–122、扫描页134–137。允许空块仅改变语法呈现，空块可以用未出现在矩阵内的新关系变量填充，查询表达力与非空块约定相同。修复存在二阶文件和本文件对 Sigma_1 的重复且不一致定义；二阶矩阵使用允许指定自由关系变量、但没有二阶量词的矩阵接口；不是把关系变量当作词汇符号。一般 Q(SO) 已由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 定义，不在此重新定义；SO句子可前束化是用于层次覆盖的数学事实，不能以新的Q定义偷换掉它。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-language","status":"resolved","id":"ff5b73e2fc5d5965","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$。关系变量、无二阶量词矩阵 $\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]$、自由变量 $\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2$ 和形式量词块取 [[29-df-second-order]]；模型类取 [[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$。关系变量、无二阶量词矩阵 $\\operatorname{Mat}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau;V]$、自由变量 $\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2$ 和形式量词块取 [[29-df-second