R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf Q_1^{\\forall}\\bar R_1)\\cdots(\\mathsf Q_k^{\\forall}\\bar R_k)\\psi\\mid(\\bar R_1,\\ldots,\\bar R_k,\\psi)\\in\\mathcal P_{k,\\tau}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_k^1[\\tau]\\},\\quad Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{SO}}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Pi_k^1[\\tau]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3238,"backlinks":[{"id":"d76c8b012650fb73","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-so-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-so-hierarchy]] — `\\Sigma_k^1`、`\\Pi_k^1` 及其查询类"},{"id":"dd316f316437dd24","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^1[\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-so-hierarchy]] 的唯一正式定义，允许长度零的二阶前缀。"},{"id":"e052662a4a07aa17","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-so-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-so-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["4db9fd38055efd65","ff5b73e2fc5d5965","b89b00b2e37a4ae5","8372f1f6b9135d87"]}